OL,3,CMan dies after getting into difficulty
OL,4,Coff Sussex coast
OL,6,FA man has died after getting into
OL,7,Fdifficulty in the sea off West
OL,8,FWittering beach.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Farea near the Beach Cafe, Pound Road,
OL,12,Faround 2.30pm on Sunday following
OL,13,Freports of two adults in the water.
OL,15,FTwo men were pulled from the sea and
OL,16,Freceived treatment from ambulance
OL,17,Fcrews.
OL,26,@sD@Xrr
