OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785167295
OL,3,CMan dies after getting into difficulty
OL,4,Coff Sussex coast
OL,6,FIn a statement, Sussex Police said:
OL,7,F"Sadly, one of the men was pronounced
OL,8,Fdead at the scene. The other man has
OL,9,Fbeen taken to hospital as a
OL,10,Fprecaution."
OL,12,FThe force said the men are not
OL,13,Fbelieved to be known to each other.
OL,15,FThe men's family have been told.
OL,17,FThe case has been passed to the
OL,18,Fcoroner's office.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
