OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785167295
OL,3,CMan dies after getting into difficulty
OL,4,Coff Sussex coast
OL,6,FIn a post on Facebook, West Wittering
OL,7,FBeach administrators said: "We are
OL,8,Fdeeply saddened to confirm that a 55-
OL,9,Fyear-old man has sadly passed away
OL,10,Ffollowing an incident at West
OL,11,FWittering Beach today.
OL,13,F"Our lifeguards responded immediately
OL,14,Fand together with the ambulance
OL,15,Fservice, coastguard and other
OL,16,Femergency services, provided advanced
OL,17,Ffirst aid and CPR.
OL,19,F"Despite their best efforts, he was
OL,20,Fsadly pronounced deceased.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
