CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785167295
OL,3,CMan dies after getting into difficulty
OL,4,Coff Sussex coast
OL,6,F"The circumstances surrounding this
OL,7,Fincident are currently being
OL,8,Festablished, and it would be
OL,9,Finapppropriate to speculate at this
OL,10,Ftime.
OL,12,F"Our thoughts and sincere condolences
OL,13,Fare with the man's family, friends and
OL,14,Fall those affected by this tragic
OL,15,Fincident. We would like to thank our
OL,16,Flifeguards, emergency service
OL,17,Fcolleagues and members of the public
OL,18,Fwho assisted during the response.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
